  "body": "Imagine being just 99 steps away from feeling the sand between your toes, enjoying morning beach walks, afternoon swims and the relaxed coastal lifestyle that makes Manly such a sought-after place to call home.\r\n\r\nConstructed from rendered block and cedar, the home offers a combination of solid construction and natural character, perfectly complementing its relaxed coastal setting.\r\n\r\nThis spacious four-bedroom home offers flexibility, comfort and plenty of room for the whole family.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom features a beautifully renovated ensuite, accessed through a generous walk-through wardrobe. An additional small office provides the perfect work-from-home space or could easily be transformed into a his-and-hers wardrobe.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms and a family bathroom, while another bedroom upstairs enjoys its own large, sun-soaked balcony. This upstairs room also offers the flexibility to be used as a second living area, depending on your needs. A second small office upstairs provides even more options for working from home or creating a quiet study space.\r\n\r\nThe newly renovated open-plan kitchen flows seamlessly into the dining area, complemented by a fireplace that creates a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous section, the property also features a vegetable garden at the rear, perfect for those who enjoy growing their own produce. All of the land is usable, offering plenty of space for families to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe rumpus room provides a fantastic blank canvas, whether you're looking for a teenage retreat, a large home office, a gym or an additional recreational space. This room forms part of the main home rather than being separate.\r\n\r\nA huge loft provides excellent additional storage, while the single garage at the rear offers space for your vehicle, garden tools or equipment.\r\n\r\nThe rear carport and generous parking area comfortably accommodate approximately 6-8 vehicles, a rare bonus in such a sought-after coastal location.\r\n\r\nWith a reserve bordering the property, there's an added sense of space and privacy that makes this home feel even more special.\r\n\r\nWhether it's morning strolls along the beach, afternoon swims or simply enjoying everything this fantastic location has to offer, this is a home where lifestyle truly comes first.\r\n\r\n99 steps to the sand. A location you'll love. \r\n\r\nOrewa: Auction: 4:00pm, Thursday 12th November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa, (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
